#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:4
msgid "Плагин для IntelliJ IDEA для работы с платформой Citeck"
msgstr "IntelliJ IDEA Plugin for the Citeck Platform"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:7
msgid "Содержание"
msgstr "Contents"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:9
msgid ""
"Плагин для IntelliJ IDEA ускоряет работу с проектами и артефактами "
"платформы Citeck. Поддерживаются `Community и Ultimate версии IntelliJ "
"IDEA <https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/download>`_."
msgstr ""
"The IntelliJ IDEA plugin speeds up work with Citeck platform projects and "
"artifacts. Both `Community and Ultimate editions of IntelliJ IDEA "
"<https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/download>`_ are supported."

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:11
msgid ""
"Исходный код плагина: `ecos-idea-plugin <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-"
"idea-plugin>`_"
msgstr ""
"Plugin source code: `ecos-idea-plugin <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-"
"idea-plugin>`_"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:15
msgid "Минимально необходимые версии:"
msgstr "Minimum required versions:"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:17
msgid "IntelliJ IDEA — 2022.2.5."
msgstr "IntelliJ IDEA — 2022.2.5."

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:18
msgid "Citeck — 4.2"
msgstr "Citeck — 4.2"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:21
msgid "Установка плагина"
msgstr "Plugin Installation"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:23
msgid ""
"Скачайте дистрибутив плагина из `release page <https://github.com/Citeck"
"/ecos-idea-plugin/releases>`_ или соберите из исходников самостоятельно."
msgstr ""
"Download the plugin distribution from the `release page <https://github.com/Citeck"
"/ecos-idea-plugin/releases>`_ or build it from source yourself."

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:25
msgid ""
"Далее установите плагин в IDEA: **Settings -> Plugins -> Install Plugin "
"from disk**"
msgstr ""
"Then install the plugin in IDEA: **Settings -> Plugins -> Install Plugin "
"from disk**"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:32
msgid "Обновление плагина"
msgstr "Plugin Update"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:34
msgid ""
"Для обновления скачайте последнюю версию дистрибутива плагина из `release"
" page <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-idea-plugin/releases>`_"
msgstr ""
"To update, download the latest plugin distribution from the `release "
"page <https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-idea-plugin/releases>`_"

#: ../../general/developer_tools/IDEA_plugin.rst:36
msgid ""
"Удалите старую версию из **Settings -> Plugins** и установите последнюю "
"версию плагина **Settings -> Plugins -> Install Plugin from disk**"
msgstr ""
"Remove the old version via **Settings -> Plugins** and install the latest "
"version via **Settings -> Plugins -> Install Plugin from disk**"

